      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not a bug, imo. Orange/red status only hides your location (from social tab/profile), but not from the list of instances of a world unless you have no permissions to join (think Invite/Invite+/closed instance). If the instance type grants permissions to join or the user has been granted a permission previously, you are joinable regardless of your profile's status. API tools already exist for this profiling (records and checks the 30-ish worlds you visit the most).\n\nI think this is intended behavior and as described in the status selection. To clarify, orange \"Ask Me\" will not keep others from joining you @{69d28b55a4b6d376ad9cf70b|full_name}!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
