      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}\n\n Join Me\n\nAuto-accept invite requests\n\nOnline\n\nSee invite requests\n\nAsk Me\n\n Hide location, see invite requests\n\nDo Not Disturb\n\nHide location, hide invite requests\n\nThis is what it says. My friend used to have their status set to \"online\" all the time, but had to change it to \"ask me\" because other users could join without needing invites.\n\nWhilst \"ask me\" people  would need an invite in order to join.\n\nI don't know if I'm reading it wrong but for a while the game had me ask for an invite while user was online.",
