      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Aside, for clarification: Dropping a portal to an Invite/Invite+ instance grants everyone in the current instance join permissions too, even after the portal disappears after timeout.\n\nIf you don't want uninvited guests in your Invite/Invite+ instances either, create it, join the instance and then invite whomever you want to be able to join, without dropping a portal.",
