      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{69d28b55a4b6d376ad9cf70b|full_name} No, we don’t. If you want to be private, create an Invite or Invite+ instance. If you are Red or Orange and in a publicly available instance, people may still find you, either by accident or because the instance allows discovery.\n\nFriends, Friends+, Group, Group+, Group Public, and Public instances can be discovered via the API and are not hidden.\n\nYour online status does not hide the existence of an instance. That is not how VRChat works. Orange and Red only hide your location from the friends tab. They do not hide your instance if it is above Invite or Invite+. The instance is separate from your status.\n\nSummay: Your Online status shows/or hides you in your friends list. It will not hide my available instances.\n\nTag: @{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
